{"seq":2,"slug":"dart-runtime-concurrency","title":"Dart 运行时与并发模型：Event Loop、Future、Isolate","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/foundations/dart-runtime-concurrency","wordCount":1032,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"dart-运行时与并发模型-event-loop-future-isolate\">Dart 运行时与并发模型：Event Loop、Future、Isolate</h1><p>Dart 是 Flutter 的唯一编程语言，其并发模型与 JavaScript 的事件循环高度相似，但增加了 <strong>Isolate</strong>（真并行执行单元）作为多核计算手段。理解这套模型是写出既流畅又高效的 Flutter 应用的基础。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Isolate</strong></td>\n<td>Dart 的独立执行单元，拥有独立内存堆，通过消息传递通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Event Loop</strong></td>\n<td>单线程调度器，交替处理 Microtask Queue 和 Event Queue</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Microtask Queue</strong></td>\n<td>高优先级队列，存放 <code>Future.then</code> 等微任务，在下一个事件前清空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Event Queue</strong></td>\n<td>普通优先级队列，存放 I/O 回调、Timer、用户输入等宏任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Future</strong></td>\n<td>代表一个异步操作的最终结果（单值）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Stream</strong></td>\n<td>代表随时间产生的异步值序列（多值）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Zone</strong></td>\n<td>异步执行上下文，用于全局错误捕获和依赖注入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>compute()</strong></td>\n<td>Flutter 提供的便利 API，在新 Isolate 中执行一次性任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dart-执行模型-单线程-事件循环\">Dart 执行模型：单线程 + 事件循环</h2><p>Dart 程序默认运行在单一执行线程（main isolate）中。没有共享内存的多线程，也没有 JavaScript 的回调地狱——Dart 使用 <code>async/await</code> 语法糖包裹 <code>Future</code>，使异步代码读起来像同步代码。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;  subgraph MainIsolate[&quot;Main Isolate(Dart VM 主线程)&quot;]&#10;    EL[Event Loop]&#10;    subgraph MQ[&quot;Microtask Queue(高优先级)&quot;]&#10;      M1[Future.then\\n回调]&#10;      M2[scheduleMicrotask\\n回调]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph EQ[&quot;Event Queue(普通优先级)&quot;]&#10;      E1[I/O 完成事件]&#10;      E2[Timer 回调]&#10;      E3[用户输入事件]&#10;      E4[Flutter 帧信号]&#10;    end&#10;    EL --&gt;|先清空| MQ&#10;    EL --&gt;|再取一个| EQ&#10;  end\">graph TB\n  subgraph MainIsolate[\"Main Isolate(Dart VM 主线程)\"]\n    EL[Event Loop]\n    subgraph MQ[\"Microtask Queue(高优先级)\"]\n      M1[Future.then\\n回调]\n      M2[scheduleMicrotask\\n回调]\n    end\n    subgraph EQ[\"Event Queue(普通优先级)\"]\n      E1[I/O 完成事件]\n      E2[Timer 回调]\n      E3[用户输入事件]\n      E4[Flutter 帧信号]\n    end\n    EL --&gt;|先清空| MQ\n    EL --&gt;|再取一个| EQ\n  end</pre><p><strong>执行顺序规则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>同步代码立即执行</li>\n<li>Microtask Queue 中的任务在下一个事件之前全部执行完</li>\n<li>Event Queue 每次只取出一个事件处理</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"为什么-flutter-ui-不会阻塞\">为什么 Flutter UI 不会阻塞？</h3><p>Flutter 的帧调度（VSync 信号处理）通过 Event Queue 驱动。只要不在同步代码中执行耗时操作（&gt; 16ms），UI 线程就不会卡顿。耗时操作必须：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <code>async/await</code> 让出控制权</li>\n<li>或放入 Isolate 中真并行执行</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"future-与-async-await\">Future 与 async/await</h2><p><code>Future&lt;T&gt;</code> 代表一个将在未来某时刻完成的值。<code>async/await</code> 是 Future 的语法糖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// Future 链式调用（老写法）&#10;Future&lt;String&gt; fetchUser(int id) {&#10;  return httpGet(&#39;/users/$id&#39;)&#10;    .then((response) =&gt; response.body)&#10;    .then((body) =&gt; json.decode(body)[&#39;name&#39;] as String);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// async/await（推荐写法，等价）&#10;Future&lt;String&gt; fetchUser(int id) async {&#10;  final response = await httpGet(&#39;/users/$id&#39;);&#10;  final body = await response.body;&#10;  return json.decode(body)[&#39;name&#39;] as String;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Future 链式调用（老写法）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;String> fetchUser(int id) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return httpGet('/users/$id')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .then((response) => response.body)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .then((body) => json.decode(body)['name'] as String);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// async/await（推荐写法，等价）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;String> fetchUser(int id) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final response = await httpGet('/users/$id');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final body = await response.body;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return json.decode(body)['name'] as String;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"future-的内部状态机\">Future 的内部状态机</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; Uncompleted: Future 创建&#10;  Uncompleted --&gt; Completed_Value: completer.complete(value)&#10;  Uncompleted --&gt; Completed_Error: completer.completeError(error)&#10;  Completed_Value --&gt; [*]: then() 回调执行&#10;  Completed_Error --&gt; [*]: catchError() / onError 执行\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; Uncompleted: Future 创建\n  Uncompleted --&gt; Completed_Value: completer.complete(value)\n  Uncompleted --&gt; Completed_Error: completer.completeError(error)\n  Completed_Value --&gt; [*]: then() 回调执行\n  Completed_Error --&gt; [*]: catchError() / onError 执行</pre><h3 id=\"错误处理\">错误处理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"Future&lt;void&gt; loadData() async {&#10;  try {&#10;    final data = await fetchFromNetwork();&#10;    processData(data);&#10;  } on NetworkException catch (e) {&#10;    // 捕获特定类型&#10;    handleNetworkError(e);&#10;  } catch (e, stackTrace) {&#10;    // 捕获所有未知错误&#10;    logger.error(&#39;Unexpected error&#39;, e, stackTrace);&#10;    rethrow;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> loadData() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final data = await fetchFromNetwork();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    processData(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } on NetworkException catch (e) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 捕获特定类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    handleNetworkError(e);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } catch (e, stackTrace) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 捕获所有未知错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    logger.error('Unexpected error', e, stackTrace);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    rethrow;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"stream-异步数据流\">Stream：异步数据流</h2><p><code>Stream&lt;T&gt;</code> 是 Future 的多值版本，代表随时间推移产生的一系列值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Single-subscription Stream</strong></td>\n<td>只能有一个监听者</td>\n<td>文件读取、HTTP 响应流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Broadcast Stream</strong></td>\n<td>多个监听者同时接收</td>\n<td>事件总线、WebSocket、传感器数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// Stream 基础用法&#10;Stream&lt;int&gt; countDown(int from) async* {&#10;  for (int i = from; i &gt;= 0; i--) {&#10;    yield i;&#10;    await Future.delayed(const Duration(seconds: 1));&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// StreamController 手动控制&#10;final controller = StreamController&lt;String&gt;.broadcast();&#10;&#10;// 发送事件&#10;controller.add(&#39;Hello&#39;);&#10;controller.addError(Exception(&#39;oops&#39;));&#10;&#10;// 监听&#10;final subscription = controller.stream.listen(&#10;  (data) =&gt; print(data),&#10;  onError: (e) =&gt; print(&#39;Error: $e&#39;),&#10;  onDone: () =&gt; print(&#39;Stream closed&#39;),&#10;);&#10;&#10;// 使用完毕必须取消订阅，避免内存泄漏&#10;subscription.cancel();&#10;await controller.close();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Stream 基础用法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Stream&#x3C;int> countDown(int from) async* {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (int i = from; i >= 0; i--) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    yield i;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await Future.delayed(const Duration(seconds: 1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// StreamController 手动控制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final controller = StreamController&#x3C;String>.broadcast();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 发送事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>controller.add('Hello');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>controller.addError(Exception('oops'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 监听</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final subscription = controller.stream.listen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (data) => print(data),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onError: (e) => print('Error: $e'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onDone: () => print('Stream closed'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用完毕必须取消订阅，避免内存泄漏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>subscription.cancel();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await controller.close();</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"streambuilder-在-flutter-中\">StreamBuilder 在 Flutter 中</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"StreamBuilder&lt;WeatherData&gt;(&#10;  stream: weatherService.weatherStream,&#10;  builder: (context, snapshot) {&#10;    return switch (snapshot) {&#10;      AsyncSnapshot(connectionState: ConnectionState.waiting) =&gt;&#10;        const CircularProgressIndicator(),&#10;      AsyncSnapshot(hasError: true, :final error) =&gt;&#10;        Text(&#39;Error: $error&#39;),&#10;      AsyncSnapshot(hasData: true, :final data) =&gt;&#10;        WeatherCard(data: data!),&#10;      _ =&gt; const SizedBox.shrink(),&#10;    };&#10;  },&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>StreamBuilder&#x3C;WeatherData>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  stream: weatherService.weatherStream,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  builder: (context, snapshot) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return switch (snapshot) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      AsyncSnapshot(connectionState: ConnectionState.waiting) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        const CircularProgressIndicator(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      AsyncSnapshot(hasError: true, :final error) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text('Error: $error'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      AsyncSnapshot(hasData: true, :final data) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        WeatherCard(data: data!),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      _ => const SizedBox.shrink(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"zone-异步上下文与错误捕获\">Zone：异步上下文与错误捕获</h2><p><code>Zone</code> 是 Dart 的&quot;异步执行上下文&quot;，类似于 JavaScript 的 <code>domain</code>。Flutter 的 <code>runApp</code> 运行在默认 Zone 中。Zone 的主要用途是<strong>全局错误捕获</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"void main() {&#10;  // 捕获 Flutter 框架内的未处理错误&#10;  FlutterError.onError = (FlutterErrorDetails details) {&#10;    FirebaseCrashlytics.instance.recordFlutterFatalError(details);&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  // 捕获 Dart 异步错误（Zone 层面）&#10;  runZonedGuarded(&#10;    () =&gt; runApp(const MyApp()),&#10;    (error, stack) {&#10;      FirebaseCrashlytics.instance.recordError(error, stack, fatal: true);&#10;    },&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 捕获 Flutter 框架内的未处理错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  FlutterError.onError = (FlutterErrorDetails details) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    FirebaseCrashlytics.instance.recordFlutterFatalError(details);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 捕获 Dart 异步错误（Zone 层面）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  runZonedGuarded(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    () => runApp(const MyApp()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (error, stack) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      FirebaseCrashlytics.instance.recordError(error, stack, fatal: true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"isolate-真正的并行计算\">Isolate：真正的并行计算</h2><p>Dart 的 Isolate 是独立的执行单元，拥有独立的内存堆（heap），通过<strong>消息传递</strong>（而非共享内存）通信。这消除了数据竞争，但也意味着传递的数据必须可序列化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph MainIsolate[&quot;Main Isolate(UI 线程)&quot;]&#10;    UI[Flutter UI 渲染]&#10;    SP[SendPort]&#10;    RP[ReceivePort]&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  subgraph WorkerIsolate[&quot;Worker Isolate(独立内存堆)&quot;]&#10;    WC[CPU 密集计算]&#10;    WSP[SendPort]&#10;    WRP[ReceivePort]&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  SP --&gt;|发送消息\\n值拷贝| WRP&#10;  WSP --&gt;|返回结果\\n值拷贝| RP\">graph LR\n  subgraph MainIsolate[\"Main Isolate(UI 线程)\"]\n    UI[Flutter UI 渲染]\n    SP[SendPort]\n    RP[ReceivePort]\n  end\n\n  subgraph WorkerIsolate[\"Worker Isolate(独立内存堆)\"]\n    WC[CPU 密集计算]\n    WSP[SendPort]\n    WRP[ReceivePort]\n  end\n\n  SP --&gt;|发送消息\\n值拷贝| WRP\n  WSP --&gt;|返回结果\\n值拷贝| RP</pre><h3 id=\"compute-最简单的-isolate-用法\">compute()：最简单的 Isolate 用法</h3><p><code>compute()</code> 是 Flutter 提供的 Isolate 便利 API，适合一次性任务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 在 Isolate 中解析大型 JSON&#10;Future&lt;List&lt;Product&gt;&gt; loadProducts(String jsonString) async {&#10;  return compute(_parseProducts, jsonString);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 顶层函数或静态方法（Isolate 函数不能是闭包）&#10;List&lt;Product&gt; _parseProducts(String jsonString) {&#10;  final list = json.decode(jsonString) as List;&#10;  return list.map((e) =&gt; Product.fromJson(e as Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt;)).toList();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 Isolate 中解析大型 JSON</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;List&#x3C;Product>> loadProducts(String jsonString) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return compute(_parseProducts, jsonString);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 顶层函数或静态方法（Isolate 函数不能是闭包）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>List&#x3C;Product> _parseProducts(String jsonString) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final list = json.decode(jsonString) as List;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return list.map((e) => Product.fromJson(e as Map&#x3C;String, dynamic>)).toList();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"isolate-spawn-长期运行的-worker\">Isolate.spawn()：长期运行的 Worker</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"Future&lt;void&gt; startWorker() async {&#10;  final receivePort = ReceivePort();&#10;&#10;  // 启动 Worker Isolate&#10;  await Isolate.spawn(_workerEntryPoint, receivePort.sendPort);&#10;&#10;  // 接收 Worker 的 SendPort&#10;  final sendPort = await receivePort.first as SendPort;&#10;&#10;  // 双向通信&#10;  final resultPort = ReceivePort();&#10;  sendPort.send([resultPort.sendPort, &#39;heavy_task&#39;]);&#10;  final result = await resultPort.first;&#10;  print(&#39;Result: $result&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;void _workerEntryPoint(SendPort mainSendPort) {&#10;  final receivePort = ReceivePort();&#10;  mainSendPort.send(receivePort.sendPort);&#10;&#10;  receivePort.listen((message) {&#10;    final [replyPort as SendPort, task as String] = message as List;&#10;    final result = _executeHeavyTask(task);&#10;    replyPort.send(result);&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> startWorker() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final receivePort = ReceivePort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 启动 Worker Isolate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await Isolate.spawn(_workerEntryPoint, receivePort.sendPort);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 接收 Worker 的 SendPort</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final sendPort = await receivePort.first as SendPort;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 双向通信</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final resultPort = ReceivePort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sendPort.send([resultPort.sendPort, 'heavy_task']);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final result = await resultPort.first;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  print('Result: $result');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void _workerEntryPoint(SendPort mainSendPort) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final receivePort = ReceivePort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mainSendPort.send(receivePort.sendPort);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  receivePort.listen((message) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final [replyPort as SendPort, task as String] = message as List;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final result = _executeHeavyTask(task);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    replyPort.send(result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"dart-3-x-isolate-run-与后台-isolate\">Dart 3.x：Isolate.run() 与后台 Isolate</h3><p>Dart 3.x 引入了更简洁的 <code>Isolate.run()</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// Dart 3.x 简化 API&#10;final result = await Isolate.run(() {&#10;  return heavyComputation(inputData);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Dart 3.x 简化 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final result = await Isolate.run(() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return heavyComputation(inputData);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"dart-3-x-新并发特性\">Dart 3.x 新并发特性</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Isolate.run()</code></td>\n<td>一行启动临时 Isolate</td>\n<td>Dart 2.19+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Background Isolate Channels</td>\n<td>Isolate 内直接调用 Platform Channel</td>\n<td>Flutter 3.7+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Records</td>\n<td>轻量的匿名结构体，便于 Isolate 间传递多值</td>\n<td>Dart 3.0+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Patterns</td>\n<td>解构赋值，简化消息处理</td>\n<td>Dart 3.0+</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// Records + Patterns 简化 Isolate 消息处理&#10;final (width, height, format) = await Isolate.run(() {&#10;  final image = decodeImage(rawBytes);&#10;  return (image.width, image.height, image.format); // Record&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Records + Patterns 简化 Isolate 消息处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final (width, height, format) = await Isolate.run(() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final image = decodeImage(rawBytes);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (image.width, image.height, image.format); // Record</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能对比-async-await-vs-isolate\">性能对比：async/await vs Isolate</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I/O 操作（网络、文件）</td>\n<td><code>async/await</code></td>\n<td>I/O 本身不占 CPU，让出 Event Loop 即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSON 解析（&lt; 1ms）</td>\n<td>直接同步</td>\n<td>Isolate 启动开销约 5-10ms，得不偿失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSON 解析（&gt; 10ms）</td>\n<td><code>compute()</code></td>\n<td>避免阻塞 UI 线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图片处理、加密、ML 推理</td>\n<td><code>Isolate.run()</code></td>\n<td>CPU 密集，必须并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续后台任务</td>\n<td><code>Isolate.spawn()</code> + 双向通信</td>\n<td>长期 Worker 需要复用 Isolate</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Dart 并发模型的核心是<strong>单线程 Event Loop + Isolate 真并行</strong>。UI 线程（main isolate）通过 <code>async/await</code> 处理 I/O 密集任务，通过 <code>compute()</code> / <code>Isolate.run()</code> 将 CPU 密集任务卸载到独立 Isolate。正确区分两类任务是避免 UI 卡顿的关键：I/O 操作让出 Event Loop 即可，不需要 Isolate；超过 10ms 的 CPU 运算必须放入 Isolate，否则将直接导致帧掉落。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"widget-rendering-pipeline\">Widget 树与渲染管线</a> — Event Loop 如何驱动 Flutter 帧调度</li>\n<li><a href=\"platform-channels\">Platform Channel 通信</a> — Flutter 3.7+ 支持在 Isolate 内调用 Platform Channel</li>\n<li><a href=\"../advanced/isolates-ffi\">Isolates 与 FFI</a> — 更深入的 Isolate 模式与 dart:ffi 互操作</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Dart 运行时与并发模型：Event Loop、Future、Isolate","id":"dart-运行时与并发模型-event-loop-future-isolate"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Dart 执行模型：单线程 + 事件循环","id":"dart-执行模型-单线程-事件循环"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么 Flutter UI 不会阻塞？","id":"为什么-flutter-ui-不会阻塞"},{"level":2,"text":"Future 与 async/await","id":"future-与-async-await"},{"level":3,"text":"Future 的内部状态机","id":"future-的内部状态机"},{"level":3,"text":"错误处理","id":"错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"Stream：异步数据流","id":"stream-异步数据流"},{"level":3,"text":"StreamBuilder 在 Flutter 中","id":"streambuilder-在-flutter-中"},{"level":2,"text":"Zone：异步上下文与错误捕获","id":"zone-异步上下文与错误捕获"},{"level":2,"text":"Isolate：真正的并行计算","id":"isolate-真正的并行计算"},{"level":3,"text":"compute()：最简单的 Isolate 用法","id":"compute-最简单的-isolate-用法"},{"level":3,"text":"Isolate.spawn()：长期运行的 Worker","id":"isolate-spawn-长期运行的-worker"},{"level":3,"text":"Dart 3.x：Isolate.run() 与后台 Isolate","id":"dart-3-x-isolate-run-与后台-isolate"},{"level":2,"text":"Dart 3.x 新并发特性","id":"dart-3-x-新并发特性"},{"level":2,"text":"性能对比：async/await vs Isolate","id":"性能对比-async-await-vs-isolate"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"Widget 树与渲染管线：三棵树、三阶段与帧生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/foundations/widget-rendering-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"Platform Channel 通信：Flutter 与原生平台互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/foundations/platform-channels"}}